==Battleground==
*1 [[Angel Fanboy]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*2 [[Chickful A]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 41.33 seconds<sup>1,240f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Using [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist/Rocker Cat]] along with any Health or Resistant Effect Up [[Cat Combo]]s ([[No Stage Fright (Combo)|No Stage Fright]], [[Art History (Combo)|Art History]], [[Little Warriors (Combo)|Little Warriors]]...) will help immensely here. Add in some [[:Category:Midranger-class Cats|Midrange]]/[[:Category:Backliner-class Cats|Backline]] DPS units and you should have very little trouble with this stage.

